tocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.poster.avif?t=1773973480\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.webm?t=1773973480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.mp4?t=1773973480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/9158f69580d49e3528e70d7520b6a82f.webp?t=1773973480\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure\u2014just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.                </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.poster.avif?t=1773973480\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.webm?t=1773973480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b